---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="APS Research"
  description="Extended scholarly investigations developed within the APS framework."
>
  <div class="content-wrapper">
    <section class="home-section">
      <h1>APS Research</h1>

      <p>
        APS Research presents extended scholarly investigations developed to
        the standards of theoretical biology and philosophy of biology.
      </p>

      <p>
        These works differ from shorter public-facing articles in their depth,
        technical detail, engagement with relevant literature, and contribution
        to ongoing scientific and philosophical debates.
      </p>

      <h2>Developing Research Areas</h2>

      <ul>
        <li>Biological Individuality</li>
        <li>Organised Persistence</li>
        <li>Architectural Dependency</li>
        <li>Social Normativity</li>
        <li>Environmental Responsibility</li>
        <li>Cognition and Mind</li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        The APS Research repository is currently under development.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>